{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》今晚（24日）播出的「香姑香姑桃花陣」，劇情講述車婉婉與李茵彤，目睹「香姑」沈可欣遭前男友家暴兼騙財，三人決定出手相助，在寓所天台為香姑擺「桃花陣」催旺姻緣，但卻被新來的保安楊證樺勸喻盡快離開。</p><p>之後李茵彤教香</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:24:02.165680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:01:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:17.625679+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:17.625679+00:00","content_hash":"82b3c44aa96ae86a5f6731273164fedb6befc0979b4a3a0b8188fa695230e2d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}